			"value": " A `>>`/`>>>` shift after a would-be `<...>` close keeps `<` a relational",
			"start": 20,
			"end": 95
		},
		{
			"type": "Line",
			"value": " operator: `a < b >> c` parses as `a < (b >> c)`, a comparison — not the",
			"start": 97,
			"end": 171
		},
		{
			"type": "Line",
			"value": " instantiation expression `(a<b>) > c`. Matches acorn: a shift/`>` token",
